# Build context for Dockerfile.algorithm is the CREW-dev root.
# Exclude everything, then re-include only what the algorithm image needs.
# Note: a pattern without a slash (e.g. *.md) only matches files at the root of the context.

*

# The Python package (only the parts the service uses)
!crew-algorithms/
crew-algorithms/crew_algorithms/*/
!crew-algorithms/crew_algorithms/wildfire_alg/
!crew-algorithms/crew_algorithms/envs/
!crew-algorithms/crew_algorithms/utils/
!crew-algorithms/crew_algorithms/conf/
!crew-algorithms/crew_algorithms/__init__.py

# The Unity Linux build (baked into the image)
!crew-dojo/
crew-dojo/*
!crew-dojo/Builds/
crew-dojo/Builds/*.zip

# Runtime output and junk at any depth. These rules come after the re-includes, so they win.
crew-algorithms/**/results/
crew-algorithms/**/experiment_data/
crew-algorithms/**/logs/
crew-algorithms/**/past_logs/
crew-algorithms/**/render/
crew-algorithms/**/output/
crew-algorithms/**/outputs/
crew-algorithms/**/__pycache__/
crew-algorithms/**/.pytest_cache/
crew-algorithms/**/venv/
crew-algorithms/**/.git/
crew-algorithms/**/.gitignore
crew-algorithms/**/*.pyc
crew-algorithms/**/*.log
crew-algorithms/**/*.mp4
crew-algorithms/**/*.png
crew-algorithms/**/*.jpg
crew-algorithms/**/*.csv
crew-algorithms/**/*.ipynb
crew-algorithms/**/.DS_Store
crew-algorithms/*.md
